<title>HONG KONG: Winfair year net down 61 percent.</title>
<headline>Winfair year net down 61 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   65.0  vs 170.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    19.0  vs 17.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil   vs 53.0 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    26.19 vs 68.07</p>
<p>    Turnover		     40.15 vs 92.30</p>
<p>    Company name		 Winfair Investment Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  August 19-22</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   September 3</p>
<p>NOTE - Winfair Investment is a property investment group.</p>
<p>Total dividend for the year is 32 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of three cents and special cash dividend of 10 cents) vs 17 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
